<section class="section">
        <div class="section-gap">
          <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container">
            <div class="section-header">
              <div class="section-badge">
                <div>FAQ</div>
              </div>
              <h2 class="section-heading center">Questions, answered</h2>
              <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                <p class="font-regular center">Everything you need to know before booking your plumbing service.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-wrap">
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-top">
                  <div class="faq-title">What does a Pipewise membership include?</div>
                  <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon _02">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 5V19"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-ans-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-ans">Every plan includes a whole-home plumbing inspection, priority booking, no diagnostic fee and member-only pricing on repairs. Care+ adds a second inspection, seasonal tune-ups and a deeper discount.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-top">
                  <div class="faq-title">How soon can I use my membership benefits?</div>
                  <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon _02">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 5V19"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-ans-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-ans">Straight away. Priority booking and member pricing apply from the moment your plan starts, and we will schedule your first inspection at a time that suits you.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-top">
                  <div class="faq-title">Can I upgrade from Care to Care+ later?</div>
                  <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon _02">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 5V19"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-ans-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-ans">Yes. You can move up to Care+ at any point and we will simply credit the unused portion of your current plan against the upgrade.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-top">
                  <div class="faq-title">Does the membership cover emergency call-outs?</div>
                  <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon _02">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 5V19"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-ans-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-ans">Members go to the front of the queue for emergencies and pay no diagnostic fee. The repair itself is charged at your member rate, so you always know where you stand.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-top">
                  <div class="faq-title">Is the membership transferable if I move?</div>
                  <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon _02">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 5V19"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-ans-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-ans">If you move within our service area we will transfer the remainder of your plan to your new address at no extra cost.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-top">
                  <div class="faq-title">How do I cancel or pause my plan?</div>
                  <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon _02">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 5V19"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-ans-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-ans">Just give us a call. There is no lock-in contract, and any inspections you have already paid for but not used stay available for the rest of the term.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
